    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A’ suidheachadh an uidheim agad
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentFinishedLeadText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dh’fhaoidte gun toir e beagan mhionaidean ceangal a dhèanamh ris an sgoil no àite-obrach agad. Ma dh’ullaich an sgoil no àite-obrach agad aplacaid a’ chompanaidh, roghainnean an lìonraidh, cunntasan puist-d, poileasaidhean tèarainteachd no roghainnean eile, bidh gach rud deiseil air an uidheam agad a dh’aithghearr. Mur eil inntrigeadh agad an dèidh beagan mhionaidean, fosgail aplacaid nan roghainnean is tagh “Cunntasan” > “Inntrigeadh obrach no sgoile” > “Fiosrachadh” > “Sioncronachadh”.
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentErrorFinishedTitle:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bha duilgheadas ann
  \ModernDeployment.Autopilot.Core.AutopilotSystemResources\Autopilot\EnrollmentErrorFinishedLeadText:
